          These Terms are governed by Italian law. For any dispute arising from the interpretation, execution or termination of these Terms, the Court of <span class="placeholder">[ENTER COMPETENT COURT — e.g. Milan]</span> shall have exclusive jurisdiction, save for the application of different mandatory rules protecting consumers.
        </p>

        <h2>10. Contact</h2>
        <p>
          For any request or clarification on these Terms, contact:
          <br /><a href="mailto:info@synapsisfw.it">info@synapsisfw.it</a>
        </p>

        <hr />
        <p style="font-size: 0.85rem; opacity: 0.6;">
          {lastUpdated}
        </p>
      </Prose>
    </div>
